{
  "title": "Task List",
  "description": "A to-do list in spellx, Spell in tags:  each task its own element, with Spell UI's controls;  a toolbar of actions filters it, ticking the one it shows, and a click selects tasks (shift and command for more) for a property editor that changes them all at once;  the tasks are kept in this browser, a JSON file on the server, a CSV file on the server or your atmosphere account, each a keeper in an API file of its own, picked in the app",
